        },
        "pageimage": "Camperdown_1836.jpg",
        "extract": "Three Hundred Years Hence is a utopian science fiction novel by author Mary Griffith, published in 1836.  It was the first utopian novel written in the United States. The novel was originally published in 1836 as part of Griffith's collection, Camperdown, or News from Our Neighborhood, and later published by Prime Press in 1950 in an edition of 300 copies.",
